      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Defect:** `renode-ec-launch` does not currently accept a `--transport` argument. Because it uses `argparse.ArgumentParser` without `parse_known_args`, passing `--transport spi` will cause it to crash with an `unrecognized arguments: --transport spi` error, breaking the test execution.\n\nIf `renode-ec-launch` is meant to support this, the update to that script must be included in this CL.\n\n**Idiomatic Python Suggestion:**\nRather than iterating over a tuple of enumerations to find the first match, you can express this more declaratively without a `break`:\n\n```python\n        if host_interfaces:\n            if HostInterface.SPI in host_interfaces:\n                cmd.extend([\"--transport\", HostInterface.SPI.value])\n            elif HostInterface.UART in host_interfaces:\n                cmd.extend([\"--transport\", HostInterface.UART.value])\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/671d0796-cc5c-4876-b67a-d2eab39769c1)",
