      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Defect:** Since Zephyr\u0027s `ztest` framework runs all test suites in the binary by default, this test will fail if the binary boots with the UART transport (e.g., when running the `fp_transport_uart_rw` test configuration). \n\nWhen booted with UART, `get_fp_transport_type()` will return `FP_TRANSPORT_TYPE_UART`, causing the `zassert_equal` check inside `check_protocol_info(FP_TRANSPORT_TYPE_SPI)` to fail. \n\nYou should skip the test or return early if it\u0027s booted with UART:\n\n```c\nZTEST(fp_transport_spi, test_fp_transport_spi)\n{\n\tif (get_fp_transport_type() \u003d\u003d FP_TRANSPORT_TYPE_UART) {\n\t\tztest_test_skip();\n\t\treturn;\n\t}\n\n\tcheck_protocol_info(FP_TRANSPORT_TYPE_SPI);\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/671d0796-cc5c-4876-b67a-d2eab39769c1)",
